  "title": "Our Favorite Chocolate Cake",
  "description": "This is the cake my family always traditionally took on picnics and any other family get-together. Cream may be substituted for the milk for a richer cake.",
  "authors": [
    "Jeannette Gartner"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-04-08T13:57:19-04:00",
